<title>NETHERLANDS: Rodamco plans to buy Imry.</title>
<headline>Rodamco plans to buy Imry.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch fund management group Rodamco said on Tuesday it was close to an agreement with British Barclays Bank Plc to acquire property development firm Imry Holdings.</p>
<p>Rodamco said it expected to finalise the deal within a few weeks.</p>
<p>No financial details were disclosed.  </p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
